  "body": "QUALITY BUILT TO NEW BUILDING CODE, WARM AND SPACIOUS APARTMENT! Would consider swap for a 3 bedroom property with money your way in Stanmore bay or surrounding areas. This apartment is perfectly positioned right in the heart of Stanmore Bay a highly desirable seaside suburb. Fabulous local beaches, cafes, restaurants, supermarkets, movies, doctors, gyms, good schools, daycare and Coast Plaza Mall all within walking distance or a short drive.\r\n\r\nThe apartment has two good-sized bedrooms, open plan living and functional kitchen, tiled bathroom and separate laundry with a generous dining and living area. The living and master bedroom lead out to a large, tiled deck. \r\n\r\nEasy access to this ground floor apartment from your allocated parking space, and with safety in mind, the complex is fitted with security cameras and swipe card access. The property is well looked after by the Body Corp. The fee includes insurance, water rates and maintenance. There's an on-site building manager.\r\n\r\nThe building is solid concrete quality-built construction, double glazed, well sound proofed, warm and dry in winter with heat pump for your comfort. There's heaps of parking for your guests, so it's never an issue.\r\n\r\nThe Coast is home to beautiful beaches, parks and a marina, offering plenty of recreational and lifestyle pursuits right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to downsize, retire in comfort, or start fresh with a small family, this home offers a welcoming and easy-care lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFIRST HOME BUYERS! Are you looking to buy a bank approved quality home in one of the best locations but have limited budget? This is the opportunity for you! \r\n\r\nRETIREES!  If you are thinking of retiring but still want to be independent, this is the place for you. Low maintenance and great location, everything you need is within walking distance, you wouldn't need to drive. Ground floor apartment with easy access, no need to use the lift.   \r\n\r\nINVESTORS! Popular location, easy to rent, low maintenance, really good investment property.\r\n\r\nBODY CORP FEES: $4950.30 (Annually) \r\nRATES: $2349.82 (Annually) \r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing.",
